# Runtime secrets and state written by the twin:* scripts and the seeder:
# the encrypted wallet bundle (wallets.enc.json) and its address list, the
# wallet lock file, tenant-state.json (tenant API keys, org passwords in clear
# text) and seed-state.json. Nothing under data/ is ever committed. Anchored to
# the repo root so that client/src/data/ stays tracked.
